  "description": "One day, a mysterious force drags the loner high school student Choi Su-A into a romance comic that he liked. And the person that he meets in this unknown yet familiar place is... his favorite character, the male lead Jeong Ji-Hun?! \n\nA slice-of-life drama of the inexperienced nerd Su-A growing up as he goes through ups and downs with his comic friends.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
